  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A theurge is proficient with all simple weapons. A theurge is not proficient with any type of armor or shield. Armor interferes with a theurge’s movements, which can cause his arcane spells with somatic components to fail.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/theurge#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
